  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8hsV9XT.png\" alt=\"隱形畫框\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Loader-Fabric | Forge | NeoForge-313e51?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/MC-26.2 | 26.1 | 1.21 | 1.20 | 1.19 | 1.18.2-313e51?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Side-Server-313e51?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252finvisible-frames-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/invisible-frames-mod?style=flat&logo=modrinth&color=00AF5C\" alt=\"Modrinth 下載次數\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rounds-invisible-frames\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1295518?style=flat&logo=curseforge&color=F16436\" alt=\"CurseForge 下載次數\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/Roundaround/mc-invisible-frames\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/stars/Roundaround/mc-invisible-frames?style=flat&logo=github\" alt=\"GitHub 星標數\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252froundaround\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/compact/donate/kofi-singular-alt_vector.svg\" alt=\"在 Ko-fi 支持我\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<p>透過蹲下即可輕鬆切換物品展示框的隱形狀態。操作非常簡單——右鍵點擊物品展示框時按住蹲下鍵，即可切換其隱形狀態！</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/QD87oMUf/images/1ea719bb5497f4493d476ef186a26824636acab1.gif\" alt=\"\"></p>",
